{"id":"f3d33b2db2a9723b","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-subset-sum-np-complete.md","title":"SUBSET-SUM is NP-Complete","display":"thm-subset-sum-np-complete — SUBSET-SUM is NP-Complete","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-subset-sum-np-complete","aliases":["28-thm-subset-sum-np-complete","SUBSET-SUM is NP-Complete"],"display":"thm-subset-sum-np-complete — SUBSET-SUM is NP-Complete","depends_on":["[[28-df-subset-sum]]","[[28-df-3sat]]","[[28-df-np-complete]]","[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","[[28-thm-3sat-np-complete]]"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-subset-sum-np-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-subset-sum-np-complete</span><span>SUBSET-SUM is NP-Complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-subset-sum-np-complete — SUBSET-SUM is NP-Complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4afc993386881d3c\" href=\"?note=4afc993386881d3c\" title=\"28-df-subset-sum\">28-df-subset-sum</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5408daacba221251\" href=\"?note=5408daacba221251\" title=\"28-df-3sat\">28-df-3sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8db0d5d40e579d59\" href=\"?note=8db0d5d40e579d59\" title=\"28-thm-3sat-np-complete\">28-thm-3sat-np-complete</a></span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{3SAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{3SAT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SUBSETSUM}\">\\(\\mathrm{SUBSETSUM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 见对应定义；整数采用二进制编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SUBSETSUM}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{3SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{SUBSETSUM}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SUBSETSUM}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{3SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{SUBSETSUM}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地构造：对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个变量、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 个子句，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+m\">\\(n+m\\)</span> 位的十进制数。每个变量给真/假两数，各在该变量位写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，在所满足子句位写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。每个子句再给只在该子句位写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> 的两补数；目标变量位全为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、子句位全为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"4\">\\(4\\)</span>。任何所选数的单列总和不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"6\">\\(6\\)</span>，不会进位；变量列强制每变量恰选一个真/假数，子句列能补到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"4\">\\(4\\)</span> 当且仅当已有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,2,3\">\\(1,2,3\\)</span> 个被满足文字。故子集存在当且仅当公式可满足。十进制表示仅用于构造，数值转为二进制后位长仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(n+m)\">\\(O(n+m)\\)</span>；无效语法映到固定否例。检查子集及二进制加法给出 NP 成员资格。原书习题提示经过 Exactly One 3SAT，是另一条路线。</p>\n<p>来源核对：习题2.17与提示；印刷65、532页；PDF91、558页。陈述已核对；无进位直接归约为本地展开并核对边界。</p>\n<p>R6依赖证据复核：无进位局部归约已复核，NP难性使用3SAT/Cook–Levin受限证明。本地推导记录保留；完整结论当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-subset-sum","status":"resolved","id":"4afc993386881d3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-subset-sum]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-3sat","status":"resolved","id":"5408daacba221251","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-3sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-poly-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"14088421136f8182","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-3sat-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"8db0d5d40e579d59","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-3sat-np-complete]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{3SAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SUBSETSUM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NPComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SUBSETSUM}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{3SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{SUBSETSUM}.","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"n+m","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"4","display":false},{"tex":"6","display":false},{"tex":"4","display":false},{"tex":"1,2,3","display":false},{"tex":"O(n+m)","display":false}],"bytes":1891,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"数值问题：[[28-df-subset-sum]]、[[28-thm-subset-sum-np-complete]]。"}],"outgoing":["4afc993386881d3c","5408daacba221251","7a9125ebbfdef91e","14088421136f8182","8db0d5d40e579d59"]}